WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.338 --> 00:00:14.398
stared at the shimmer.

2
00:00:14.418 --> 00:00:16.219
"It looks like a wormhole!"

3
00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:17.020
he thought.

4
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.841
"I wish I could get closer.

5
00:00:19.541 --> 00:00:20.522
Then I could tell for sure."

6
00:00:21.322 --> 00:00:23.883
But the goon was still dragging him toward the cave.

7
00:00:23.903 --> 00:00:28.646
"Zira wants you to put in a hard day's work here," Krub said.

8
00:00:28.666 --> 00:00:31.868
"So that's exactly what you're going to do."

9
00:00:32.884 --> 00:00:34.906
"How am I supposed to work like this?"

10
00:00:35.706 --> 00:00:38.548
Zann held up his shackled hands as he followed the men.

11
00:00:38.568 --> 00:00:42.591
"Once we're inside, I'll remove those shackles," Krub replied.

12
00:00:42.611 --> 00:00:45.953
"What?" The goon looked surprised.

13
00:00:45.973 --> 00:00:48.775
"There will be nothing to stop him from zapping away."

14
00:00:48.795 --> 00:00:50.376
"He won't dare."

15
00:00:50.936 --> 00:00:52.157
Krub looked smug.

16
00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:56.280
"Zira told me she's figured out how to use magic to track people.

17
00:00:57.061 --> 00:00:59.582
She'll know immediately if he leaves this area."

18
00:01:00.423 --> 00:01:01.624
Zann felt skeptical.

19
00:01:02.196 --> 00:01:03.757
He'd never heard of such a spell.

20
00:01:04.578 --> 00:01:07.960
Then again, Zira was learning magic at a fast pace.

21
00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:13.544
"Back in Magica, we can find someone using a Uniting spell," he thought.

22
00:01:13.564 --> 00:01:15.645
"But that's only if they want to be found.

23
00:01:16.366 --> 00:01:20.609
Otherwise the only option is to use the Directory to find out where they live, or maybe use

24
00:01:20.629 --> 00:01:22.170
a spy fly to spy on them."

25
00:01:23.811 --> 00:01:25.372
He thought about telling Krub that.

26
00:01:26.076 --> 00:01:32.099
If Krub knew that Zira couldn't magically spy on him, maybe Zann could convince the man to rebel

27
00:01:32.159 --> 00:01:32.679
against her.

28
00:01:33.239 --> 00:01:36.521
After all, Krub already defied her by making fire.

29
00:01:36.541 --> 00:01:42.523
"So watch yourself, boy," Krub warned Zann with a nasty smile.

30
00:01:42.543 --> 00:01:45.845
"And if you're thinking about escaping, think again.

31
00:01:46.445 --> 00:01:49.887
Because if you misbehave, Zira might punish your friends."

32
00:01:50.827 --> 00:01:51.607
Zann gulped.

33
00:01:52.876 --> 00:01:56.837
Would Zira really hurt Perda or Mellis if he didn't do as she wished?

34
00:01:57.457 --> 00:01:59.058
He wasn't willing to take that chance.

35
00:01:59.078 --> 00:02:01.818
"Don't worry, I'll behave," Zann said.

36
00:02:01.838 --> 00:02:08.220
"Good." Krub murmured a word under his breath, and Zann's arm shackles disappeared.

37
00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:10.281
Zann was disappointed.

38
00:02:11.021 --> 00:02:13.542
Once again he'd failed to hear the password.

39
00:02:14.382 --> 00:02:17.703
Next Krub rubbed his hands together and created a shovel.

40
00:02:18.323 --> 00:02:19.603
He handed it to Zann.

41
00:02:19.623 --> 00:02:21.264
"Now start digging."

42
00:02:21.284 --> 00:02:23.501
"Why?" Zann said.

43
00:02:23.521 --> 00:02:26.763
"It should be easy to extract whatever you want by using magic."

44
00:02:26.783 --> 00:02:30.046
"That's not how Zira wants you to do it."

45
00:02:30.767 --> 00:02:32.808
Krub's smile was nastier than ever.

46
00:02:32.828 --> 00:02:34.250
"Get to work!"

47
00:02:37.452 --> 00:02:43.077
An hour later Zann was sweaty, exhausted, and covered in dust and grit.

48
00:02:43.697 --> 00:02:45.139
He also felt frustrated.

49
00:02:45.759 --> 00:02:51.344
He kept trying to tell Krub that he could do what Zira wanted better and faster with magic.

50
00:02:52.032 --> 00:02:54.093
"Why does she want us to find this stuff anyway?"

51
00:02:54.513 --> 00:02:55.054
he asked.

52
00:02:55.654 --> 00:02:56.394
"What did you call it?

53
00:02:56.775 --> 00:03:00.717
Crumblestone?" "That's the stuff," Krub said.

54
00:03:00.737 --> 00:03:02.298
"It's very delicate.

55
00:03:03.098 --> 00:03:05.479
That's why you have to dig it out the old-fashioned way.

56
00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:08.541
Zira is afraid that using magic might damage it."

57
00:03:09.361 --> 00:03:10.642
"But why does she want it?"

58
00:03:11.102 --> 00:03:12.103
Zann asked again.

59
00:03:12.783 --> 00:03:13.624
Krub shrugged.

60
00:03:13.644 --> 00:03:17.646
"It's one of the main ingredients in those potions she's famous for.

61
00:03:18.586 --> 00:03:21.268
She thinks it will make her new magic even stronger."

62
00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.681
"But that's not true," Zann said.

63
00:03:24.701 --> 00:03:27.561
"Regular magic is caused by friction—that's all.

64
00:03:28.261 --> 00:03:29.742
Potions don't have any effect on it."

65
00:03:30.122 --> 00:03:33.303
He frowned, trying to remember his lessons from school.

66
00:03:33.323 --> 00:03:35.623
"At least I don't think they do."

67
00:03:36.144 --> 00:03:37.584
The goon rolled his eyes.

68
00:03:37.604 --> 00:03:39.064
"What do you know?

69
00:03:39.124 --> 00:03:40.225
You're just a kid."

70
00:03:40.945 --> 00:03:43.286
He wiped his brow and turned to Krub.

71
00:03:43.306 --> 00:03:44.946
"It's hot in this cave.

72
00:03:45.546 --> 00:03:46.947
Let's go outside for a drink."

73
00:03:47.567 --> 00:03:49.727
Krub nodded and then glared at Zann.

74
00:03:49.747 --> 00:03:52.168
"Don't try anything, kid.

75
00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:55.442
Remember, Zira is watching!"

76
00:03:56.643 --> 00:03:58.165
Zann was glad to see them go.

77
00:03:58.845 --> 00:04:01.387
There were no other miners in this part of the cave.

78
00:04:01.968 --> 00:04:04.510
So he rubbed his hands together to create friction.

79
00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:07.833
"Crumblestone," he said as a focusing word.

80
00:04:08.453 --> 00:04:10.815
A large chunk of soft stone appeared.

81
00:04:11.396 --> 00:04:15.539
It looked exactly like the smaller chunks of crumblestone he'd dug out so far.

82
00:04:15.559 --> 00:04:17.942
"That should satisfy them," he thought.

83
00:04:17.962 --> 00:04:20.604
"And they'll never know I didn't dig it out by hand!"

84
00:04:21.192 --> 00:04:25.095
He snapped his fingers to create food and a glass of airberry juice.

85
00:04:25.775 --> 00:04:28.037
Then he sat down on a rock to eat.

86
00:04:29.138 --> 00:04:31.139
He couldn't stop thinking about his friends.

87
00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:35.082
He wondered where Zira had sent Perda and Mellis.

88
00:04:35.643 --> 00:04:37.264
And what had happened to Zing?

89
00:04:37.824 --> 00:04:42.307
The last time Zann had seen his dragon, Zing was hiding in the tree by the well.

90
00:04:43.008 --> 00:04:45.890
Was he still there, or was he searching for Zann?

91
00:04:46.691 --> 00:04:48.392
Zann hoped the dragon was okay.

92
00:04:49.536 --> 00:04:53.860
"This world seems like Magica in some ways," Zann thought as he chewed his food.

93
00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:56.222
"But in other ways it's so different!

94
00:04:56.903 --> 00:05:01.507
It reminds me of tales about the Old Times, when Magica wasn't as modern and peaceful as it

95
00:05:01.587 --> 00:05:02.007
is now."

96
00:05:03.008 --> 00:05:04.289
He glanced around the cave.

97
00:05:04.789 --> 00:05:08.933
It looked a little like some parts of the Cave of the Unknown back in Magica.

98
00:05:09.474 --> 00:05:10.835
But it was much less scary.

99
00:05:11.315 --> 00:05:16.480
The Cave of the Unknown had all sorts of unpredictable magic energy humming in the air.

100
00:05:17.492 --> 00:05:21.355
"I guess every world has a mix of dangerous stuff and harmless stuff," he thought.

101
00:05:21.375 --> 00:05:24.017
"Except for Fardark or Drac.

102
00:05:24.698 --> 00:05:26.960
Those places are totally dangerous!"

103
00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:29.662
Zann took a sip of airberry juice.

104
00:05:29.682 --> 00:05:35.927
"At least Zira hasn't figured out how to control dark magic like old King Zanta did," Zann thought.

105
00:05:35.947 --> 00:05:42.572
"He was totally evil, ruling the entire land from his spooky old fortress deep in the mountains."

106
00:05:44.212 --> 00:05:49.734
Zann was surprised to realize how much he remembered about Magica's history from his school classes.

107
00:05:49.754 --> 00:05:52.916
"Some of it is actually pretty interesting," he thought.

108
00:05:52.936 --> 00:05:55.497
"No wonder Perda is obsessed with it lately."

109
00:05:56.517 --> 00:05:59.179
Thinking about Perda made him miss her even more.

110
00:05:59.899 --> 00:06:02.220
She'd said she would try to find him and Mellis.

111
00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:06.442
But how long should he wait before trying to find the two girls himself?

112
00:06:07.162 --> 00:06:11.584
He was so lost in his own thoughts that he failed to notice the men had returned.

113
00:06:12.425 --> 00:06:14.230
"Stop slacking, boy!"

114
00:06:14.491 --> 00:06:15.233
Krub roared.

115
00:06:15.253 --> 00:06:17.279
"Get back to work!"
